The VS Code pet overlaps and becomes visually squished by the omnibar. Quick Chat now suppresses pet creation while preserving the pet in standard Chat surfaces.

- **Change:** Exclude Quick Chat widgets from pet initialization.
- **Behavior:** Standard Chat and inline Chat behavior remain unchanged.

```ts
if (this.location === ChatAgentLocation.Chat && !isInlineChat(this) && !isQuickChat(this)) {
	// Initialize the pet
}
```

